<Base title="About · dropkit.contents" description="Public contents ledger.">
  <h1 style="font-size:1.5rem">About</h1>
  <p>
    <strong>dropkit.contents</strong> is the public kit: writing first, then images,
    then audio/video as pointers. The repo is the archive. This site is the hub.
    Social posts are copies, not the source.
  </p>
  <p>Two writing lanes:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Deep cut</strong> — mechanisms, infra, papers, chips. SV and China.</li>
    <li><strong>Scoreboard</strong> — a table, two lines of prose. Models and new apps.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="meta">
    Voice files live in <code>persona/</code>. Failed factory runs never land here.
  </p>
  <p><a href="/">← Drops</a></p>
</Base>
